USE OF THIS SOFTWARE

This project clones how a real person writes and speaks. The MIT terms above
cover the code only. They do not grant permission to clone anyone.

Cloning a person's texting style or voice without their informed, explicit
consent may be unlawful where you live, and is harmful regardless. Voice
cloning in particular is regulated in a growing number of jurisdictions.

Before you use this on anyone:
  - get their clear, informed consent, for both text and voice separately
  - tell them where the clone will run and who can talk to it
  - honour any request to delete the clone, the derived data and the voice
  - never present a clone's output as something the real person actually said

The personas included by the author were created with the consent of the
people involved.
